<title>USA: Georgia Power 900 MW coal unit in start up.</title>
<headline>Georgia Power 900 MW coal unit in start up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia Power Co said the 900 megawatt (MW) Scherer 1 coal-fired power unit in Juliette, Ga, shut Monday due to a boiler leak, has restarted and is operating at about 85 percent power.</p>
<p>Georgia Power, a unit of Southern Co, is the operator of the plant.</p>
<p>Oglethorpe Power Corp has a 60 percent interest in Scherer unit 1.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
